    "Python and TypeScript identity cases check mocked acknowledgments and in-memory token continuity, not durable storage, endpoint commitment, actual restart or exact E050 refusal semantics.",
    "Five shared fixture rows do not establish identical SDK test coverage or fifteen native executions. A supervised-restart row is not a process restart.",
